  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "すさまじい　せいりょうを　もつ。\nシャウトとともに　いかくするさまは\nブロッキングと　よばれている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "엄청난 성량을 가졌다.\n샤우팅하며 위협하는 모습은\n블로킹이라 불린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能夠發出驚人的音量。\n牠在大叫的同時威嚇對手\n的樣子被稱為「攔堵」。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il possède une puissance vocale remarquable.\nOn appelle Blocage sa technique qui consiste\nà intimider l’ennemi avec son cri guttural.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es verfügt über eine beeindruckende Stimmkraft.\nSein von Schreien begleitetes Drohverhalten\nnennt man auch „Abblocker“.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La potencia de su voz es realmente pasmosa. La\ntécnica que usa para intimidar al rival mientras\ngrita recibe el nombre de Obstrucción.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha una potenza vocale impressionante. Quando\nassume la tipica posa intimidatoria e si mette a\nurlare, si dice che sta facendo “sbarramento”.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its voice is staggering in volume. Obstagoon\nhas a tendency to take on a threatening posture\nand shout—this move is known as Obstruct.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "凄まじい　声量を　もつ。\nシャウトとともに　威嚇するさまは\nブロッキングと　呼ばれている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能够发出惊人的音量。\n它在大叫的同时威吓对手\n的样子被称为“拦堵”。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La potencia de su voz es realmente pasmosa. La\ntécnica que usa para intimidar al rival mientras\ngrita recibe el nombre de Obstrucción.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ケンカを　くりかえし　しんか。\nうでをクロスし　さけぶ　おたけびは\nどんな　あいても　ひるませるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "싸움을 반복하면서 진화한다.\n팔을 크로스하고 우렁차게 외치면\n어떤 상대라도 풀죽게 된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在不斷的鬥爭中得到了進化。\n牠交叉著雙臂發出的怒吼\n能讓一切對手都為之膽怯。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il a évolué après avoir enchaîné de nombreux\ncombats. Le cri qu’il pousse lorsqu’il fait un « X »\navec ses bras ébranle n’importe quel ennemi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Durch das Austragen unzähliger Kämpfe hat es\nsich entwickelt. Formt es mit den Armen ein „X“\nund stößt einen Schrei aus, verschreckt das jeden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Evoluciona tras haber librado numerosas peleas.\nEl grito de guerra que profiere mientras pone los\nbrazos en cruz atemoriza a cualquier rival.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si è evoluto a forza di lottare. L’urlo di guerra\nche lancia mentre mette le braccia a X è in\ngrado di terrorizzare qualsiasi avversario.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It evolved after experiencing numerous fights.\nWhile crossing its arms, it lets out a shout that\nwould make any opponent flinch.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ケンカを　繰り返し　進化。\n腕をクロスし　叫ぶ　雄叫びは\nどんな　相手も　怯ませるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在不断的斗争中得到了进化。\n它交叉着双臂发出的怒吼\n能让一切对手都为之胆怯。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Evoluciona tras haber librado numerosas peleas.\nEl grito de guerra que profiere mientras pone los\nbrazos en cruz atemoriza a cualquier rival.",
